Pakistan's accession to CEDAW | ==1996== | 2016, 2018, 2019
The Beijing Conference / Platform for Action | Fourth World Conference on Women, Beijing, ==1995== | 2019, 2023, 2024 (twice), 2026
Hegemonic masculinity | R. W. (Raewyn) Connell | 2018, 2023, 2026
Judith Butler | *Gender Trouble* (1990); gender is performative | 2019, 2024, 2026
