Area | Topic | Why
Autonomy vs integration; status of Gender Studies in Pakistan | T1 | Asked four times each, but not since 2023 — due for a return
Women's vs Gender Studies; multidisciplinary nature | T1 | Four and two visits; a reliable "define and differentiate" question
Radical, Marxist, psychoanalytic and postmodern feminism | T2 | Each asked once or twice; ideal short-note material
